     2	  @moduledoc """
     3	  Owns the managed Claude Code runtime and explicit Kogen login scopes.
     4	
     5	  The runtime is one pinned native binary under Kogen's managed root, never a
     6	  `claude` from PATH, and every launch sets `DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER=1`. Kogen's
     7	  roles run unattended, so every launch also sets
     8	  `CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_SUBSTITUTION_RM_PROMPT=1`, overriding any inherited
     9	  value; otherwise Claude Code asks to confirm a recursive `rm` of
    10	  command-substitution output even with `--dangerously-skip-permissions`.
    11	  Each scope is a private `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`. Claude Code keys a scope's macOS Keychain
    12	  login by its path, so Kogen never moves or renames a scope, and it never
    13	  reads, copies or prints credential values: readiness uses only the
    14	  `loggedIn` and `authMethod` metadata of `claude auth status`.
    15	  """
    16	  use Boundary, deps: [], exports: []
    17	
    18	  @pinned_version "2.1.281"
    19	  @installer Path.expand("../../priv/kogen/claude_code/install.py", __DIR__)
