   234	  @doc """
   235	  Opens the managed interactive `claude` in the selected scope so the user
   236	  completes Claude Code's own first-run flow, including its login. Native
   237	  arguments after `--` are forwarded unchanged. The scope is selected first,
   238	  so cancellation never falls back to another login.
